OL,3,GNEWSAWoman suffered 78 injuries in
OL,4,Aattack by partner, murder trial told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis story contains details that some
OL,7,Freaders may find distressing.
OL,9,FA woman suffered 78 injuries to her
OL,10,Fhead and body after an attack by her
OL,11,Fpartner, a murder trial has been told.
OL,13,FAlexander Brennan, 54, denies murdering
OL,14,FBrodie MacGregor, 23, in her flat in
OL,15,FGlasgow's Springburn on 26 August 2024.
OL,17,FForensic pathologist, Dr Julie McAdam,
OL,18,Ftold the High Court in Glasgow that the
OL,19,Fcause of death was "extensive facial
OL,20,Finjures".
